WEBVTT

00:14:58.489 --> 00:15:00.527
and fly halfway across the globe.

00:15:00.551 --> 00:15:04.566
You'll be on the BFR for roughly
half an hour or 40 minutes,

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.034
and the longest part --
yeah, it's so awesome.

00:15:07.058 --> 00:15:08.150
(Applause)

00:15:08.174 --> 00:15:12.367
The longest part of that flight
is actually the boat out and back.

00:15:12.391 --> 00:15:13.392
(Laughter)

00:15:13.416 --> 00:15:16.818
CA: I mean. Gwynne, come on,
this is awesome, but it's crazy, right?

00:15:16.842 --> 00:15:19.692
This is never going to actually happen.

00:15:19.716 --> 00:15:21.735
GS: Oh no, it's definitely
going to happen.

00:15:21.759 --> 00:15:23.426
This is definitely going to happen.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.601
CA: How?

00:15:24.625 --> 00:15:28.759
(Applause)

00:15:28.783 --> 00:15:33.039
So first of all, countries are going
to accept this incoming missile --